        <h3 class="legal-h3">Service Availability</h3>
        <p>We aim to maintain high platform availability but do not guarantee uninterrupted access. Planned maintenance, infrastructure updates, and events outside our control may result in temporary unavailability. We will provide advance notice of planned downtime where reasonably practicable.</p>
